        "heading": "What Does Your Patients Enamel Really Need in Your Fluoride Toothpaste?",
        "subheading": "The answer is easy: Optimal cavity protection and remineralization",
        "subtitle": "The 10% Premium Difference",
        "body_text": "<p>In a Pilot Study conducted in December 2023, Dr. Jen's Super Paste (10% Nanohydroxyapatite, 0.22% fluoride, and xylitol) was tested against a high-prescription fluoride toothpaste containing 5000 ppm. Dr. Jen's Super Paste delivered six times higher levels of remineralization.</p>",
